section.social-introduction(class="relative pb-10 z-2 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,251,240,_0.00)_0%,#FFFBF0_43.9%)]")
    .container
        .section-wrapper(class="flex-center flex-col gap-6 -mt-48")
            .section-heading
                h2.heading
                    .text(class="heading-1-subpage text-primary-4 text-center font-bold")
                        | TOGETHER, WE HATCH A SUSTAINABLE POULTRY INDUSTRY FOR FUTURE GENERATION

            .section-desc
                p.desc
                    .text(class="body-1 text-Utility-gray-950 font-primary")
                        | At Bel Ga Asia, we believe people are essential to a sustainable poultry industry. Across Asia, we create opportunities through employment, talent development, employee well-being, knowledge sharing, and community engagement.

            .section-content
                .grid
                    -for(i=0;i<3;i++)
                        .item-container
                            .item-content(class="flex-center flex-col gap-4 md:gap-5 w-full h-full")
                                .item-img(class="w-[24.21%]")
                                    .img(class="img-ratio aspect-square")
                                        +PugImg()

                                .item-text(class="flex-center flex-col flex-1 gap-3")
                                    .text-title
                                        h3.title
                                            .text(class="heading-4 text-primary-1 font-bold")
                                                | Empowering Our People

                                    .text-desc(class="flex-1 px-10")
                                        p.desc
                                            .text(class="body-2 text-Utility-gray-950 text-justify")
                                                | Building capabilities, supporting well-being, and creating opportunities for our employees to grow and succeed.

            .section-desc(class="pt-14")
                p.desc
                    .text(class="body-1 text-Utility-gray-950 font-primary")
                        | At Bel Ga Asia, we believe people are essential to a sustainable poultry industry. Across Asia, we create opportunities through employment, talent development, employee well-being, knowledge sharing, and community engagement.
